---
import Card from '../Card.astro'
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="md:row-span-6" title="About me">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      Hi, I'm Geme, a software engineer from Mexico. Throughout my career, I have worked with a wide range of fullstack technologies.
      From JavaScript, React and Astro for building dynamic interfaces, to Node.js, Python and PHP for server-side development, along with databases like MongoDB and MySQL.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      Outside of coding, I enjoy video games, basketball and exploring new places.
    </p>
  </div>
</Card>
